{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552670/extras/Purple_Descriptions_Scaled.gif?t=1743275192\" /><strong>Procedural Map Generation,</strong> each time you join an online game or start a new campaign brand new maps are created</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552670/extras/Pink_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1743275192\" /><strong>Deckbuilding,</strong> Summon Undead create a Black Hole, or drop a Nuke use your best cards to achieve victory! <u><i>(9 Cards Available in Demo)</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552670/extras/Engenier_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1743275192\" /><strong>Army Building,</strong> choose from a variety of units ranging from rats up to High-tech pandas to build an undefeatable army. <u><i>(9 Units Available in Demo)</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552670/extras/Poison_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1743275192\" /><strong>Interactable Maps</strong>, throw your enemies into holes, hit explosive barrels, or trigger wasp hives to annihilate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552670/extras/Necro_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1743275192\" /><strong>Solo Campaign</strong>, play alone in the campaign mode to conquer the world and regain the original sheep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552670/extras/Ily_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1743275192\" /><strong>Online Multiplayer,</strong> join an online multiplayer match to fight and defeat other Sheeple (no limit on player count)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=